  "name": "Calling Card",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency </strong>Once per ten minutes</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You’ve affiliated yourself with a particular set of stories told in a suit of cards more than others, allowing you to more readily draw upon it at the cost of another. When you take this feat, select a suit from your Diviner’s Deck. Any time you are about to Draw a Card, you can use the Sleight effect of this feat.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Sleight </strong>Instead of rolling to @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.9Tbqe5G8pdrrOUfT]{Draw Card}, you draw a card of your preferred suit. Once within the ten minutes after using this Sleight, if you Draw a Card that is opposite this suit (three lower or higher than the suit’s number), you @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.arhOfryj6gDtqwZO]{Effect: Bust!}.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.dO8kHE5IdPa3Zoqe]{Cardplay: Sleight Used}</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.t3BbuyQNf50No4UR]{Sleight Effect: Calling Card}</p>"
    },
